## Layer Rules

<!-- HOUSE STYLE: four-layer clean architecture. Encode these rules in tooling
     (an import-verifier script or linter plugin) so they are enforceable, not
     aspirational; wire that tool into the Commands table above. -->

```
presentation/  -> depends on application/ only (never domain/)
application/   -> depends on domain/ and infrastructure/ only
domain/        -> zero framework dependencies
infrastructure/ -> depends on domain/ or external SDKs
```

Run {{IMPORT_CHECK_COMMAND}} to catch leaks.

## State & DI

<!-- HOUSE STYLE: ports-and-adapters wiring (Riverpod flavor). Keep the shape:
     interface tokens live in application/, concrete bindings in infrastructure/,
     presentation imports only the application barrel — never infrastructure. -->

- Riverpod tokens in `application/providers/repository_providers.dart`
- Concrete bindings in `infrastructure/bootstrap/infra_provider_overrides.dart`
- Presentation imports `application/providers/providers.dart` (barrel) — never infrastructure directly
- Domain ports (interfaces) in `domain/repositories/` and `domain/services/`

