## Testing

<!-- HOUSE STYLE: per-layer test strategy. Keep the layer-to-test-style mapping;
     swap framework specifics (Drift/Riverpod) for this project's equivalents. -->

- **Domain**: pure Dart, no framework dependency
- **Application**: hand-written fakes (`test/application/fake_float_plan_repository.dart`) — no mockito
- **Infrastructure**: `NativeDatabase.memory()` for Drift, `driftRuntimeOptions.dontWarnAboutMultipleDatabases = true`, import drift with `hide isNull, isNotNull` to avoid Flutter matcher clashes
- **Presentation**: `ProviderContainer` with overridden fakes

